@startuml
title UML State Machine Diagram - Sale Process

[*] --> WaitingForSale
WaitingForSale : entry / Await customer sale
WaitingForSale : do / No items added yet
WaitingForSale : exit / Move to payment

state CashPayment as CashPaid
CashPayment : entry / Customer pays with cash
CashPayment : do / Complete the sale
CashPayment : exit / Return to waiting for sale

state CardOrCheckPayment as PaymentVerification
PaymentVerification : entry / Customer chooses card or check
PaymentVerification : do / Verify payment
PaymentVerification : exit / Complete the sale if approved

state WaitingForItems as WaitingForItemEntry
WaitingForItems : entry / Await customer items selection
WaitingForItems : do / Enter items one by one
WaitingForItems : exit / Move to payment

WaitingForSale --> WaitingForItems
WaitingForItems --> PaymentVerification
PaymentVerification --> CashPayment
CashPayment --> WaitingForSale
PaymentVerification --> [*]
@enduml
